"Finding this plugin useful? A quick review really helps others discover it —"
" thank you!"
msgstr ""
"¿Te resulta útil este plugin? Una breve reseña ayuda a que otros lo "
"descubran. ¡Gracias!"

#: includes/class-phcite-admin.php:0
msgid "Leave a review ★★★★★"
msgstr "Deja una reseña ★★★★★"

#: includes/class-phcite-admin.php:0
msgid "No thanks"
msgstr "No, gracias"
